1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,023
Four rules separate a printed letter from a rejected one.

2
00:00:04,023 --> 00:00:10,104
One issue only: a letter about roads, load shedding and exams at once gets cut.

3
00:00:10,104 --> 00:00:18,216
Say when and where: the lights on the Milanchowk stretch have been dark since Baisakh is evidence; there are many problems is not.

4
00:00:18,216 --> 00:00:21,263
Name who can act, and exactly what they should do.

5
00:00:21,263 --> 00:00:23,906
And sign with your full name and place.

